        <fields>
            <name>Image_Pack_site_location_images_of_the_site</name>
            <fieldText>Image Pack: (site location,    images of the site)</fieldText>
            <fieldType>LargeTextArea</fieldType>
            <helpText>&lt;p&gt;For a comprehensive understanding of the site, it is advisable to prepare PowerPoint slides containing Google Maps views and photographs of the site. These visuals can offer valuable context and assist in evaluating the location and its surroundings. In certain instances, Inspectors have included photographs in the Annex section of their Inspector Reports, which should be reviewed for additional perspectives. It is recommended to inspect the site independently using Google Maps, as this may provide different viewpoints compared to those documented by the Inspectors. This approach ensures a thorough assessment and supports informed decision-making regarding the development.]] Development description: Development Use and Impact on Electric Pole [[The intended use of the development and the specific proposals put forward are crucial in determining whether the presence of the electric pole/ electric lines will have an impact on the current or proposed development. Careful consideration must be given to how the development will interact with existing infrastructure, as this may influence the planning and execution of the project.&lt;/p&gt;</helpText>
